cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Photo to 3D: a Gaussian Splatting reconstruction pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A one-command pipeline that turns a set of photographs into a real-time 3D
  model by combining camera-pose estimation (COLMAP) with 3D Gaussian Splatting
  training (LichtFeld Studio). Developed as a Bachelor's thesis at the University
  of Alicante, together with a systematic study of how capture configuration
  affects reconstruction quality.
type: software
